cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the version archived with this release."
type: software
title: "Vision-based fixture recognition for WAAM substrate plates"
authors:
  - given-names: Tomek
    family-names: Poll
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-4992-9830"
    affiliation: "Hochschule Ruhr West"
abstract: >-
  A camera-based system for supporting the setup process of a wire arc
  additive manufacturing cell. The software references a monocular camera
  using ChArUco fiducials, transforms image coordinates into work-object
  coordinates, supports assisted definition of the usable welding area,
  detects marked clamping elements, and transfers the resulting geometry
  to Rhino for CAD/CAM planning.
keywords:
  - WAAM
  - computer vision
  - camera calibration
  - ChArUco
  - ArUco
  - workpiece localization
  - CAD/CAM
repository-code: "https://github.com/Coder861/waam-fixture-recognition"
